Construct your login URL by combining your Cognito domain, client ID, and CloudFront URL into this format:

https://your-prefix.auth.us-east-1.amazoncognito.com/oauth2/authorize?response_type=token&client_id=your-app-client-id&redirect_uri=https://dXXXXXXXXXX.cloudfront.net&scope=openid+profile+email
